        "raw": "<div>Yes, I really want to know that if there are some guys that playing Path of Exile too.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>You know, I used to play Path of Exile all my free time, and I think it&#39;s dangerous for me, so I turn to GTG games, which not make me make me addicted</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>But I think some Path of Exile players maybe on this forum too, I have collected some a lot of builds for my PoE journey.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>I don&#39;t want my&nbsp; fruits of its labours go to waste, so I&#39;d like to share some here:</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; Frost Blades Trickster 3.1 | Path of Exile Build Overview &amp; Showruns T13 &amp; T14 | Have fun! - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=edyecaCt1nE</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; Path of Exile The Weirdest Builds - https://esportsedition.com/general/path-of-exile-the-weirdest-builds/</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; Path of Exile Blade Flurry-Duelist Charakter-Guide - https://www.mmozone.de/path-of-exile-blade-flurry-duelist-charakter-guide-patch-3-0-0/</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; Starters Hierophant Templar Builds for Abyss League - https://www.r4pg.com/path-of-exile/news/starters-hierophant-templar-builds-for-abyss-league</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; Who wanted a +1 Gems Shaped Vaal Regalia? I GOTCHU (Behemoth Hide) | Demi - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9fiKUlpRTNA</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; [3.1] Demi&#39;s TasteTheLemon, CI Or Life Cospri&#39;s Malice CoC Discharge Assassin Build Guide - http://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/1961879</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; [3.1 Ready] The Swordmaster - dual-wield crit slayer - all content down/videos up - http://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/2036681</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; Path of Exile 3.1 Beginner Guide - https://www.iskmogul.com/path-of-exile-3-0-beginner-guide/</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; 2 Fast Clear Speed Guardian Templar Builds - Path of Exile 3.1 - https://www.r4pg.com/path-of-exile/news/2-fast-clear-speed-guardian-templar-builds---path-of-exile-3-1</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; 3.1 -- Righteous Fire Berserker -- All Content - http://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/1985355</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; (3.1) Queenliness Wanderfinder - http://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/1764075</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>✔&nbsp; 3.1 Burning Ground Pitch Darkness Build - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mzhu34WJB-4</div><div>.</div><div>.</div><div>.</div><div>Ok, to be honest, these Path of Exile builds are not created by myself, I collected them from <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/pathofexilebuildlist/\">r/</a><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/pathofexilebuildlist/\">pathofexilebuildlist</a>, <a href=\"http://www.pathofexile.com/forum\">PoE official forum</a>, <a href=\"https://www.poebuilds.cc/\">poebuilds.cc</a> and some other PoE build sites, it&#39;s not so easy to do this, so I hope these builds can be helpful to some PoE players there</div><div>&nbsp;</div>",
