        "raw": "<p>Hi, welcome to the forum :). Wow, that&#39;s a lot of links. I don&#39;t really have the time or inclination to go through them right now, but I have played Path of Exile. Last time was probably a couple of years ago, though - I know the game has changed a lot since then. It was good fun, though the end game stuff got pretty ridiculous - I was playing through with a friend and we did most of the late-game bosses by just zerging it, running in and getting off maybe one or two attacks before the boss would vaguely glance in our direction and insta-kill us. Repeat for, like, an hour and a half :P. And the exp loss on death at Merciless difficulty made it almost not worth attempting to level any more - you could spend an hour carefully grinding your way up the exp bar, and then lose all of it (and then some) to one single death. Not fun.</p><p>But apart from that, good game :). I like the way the skills and stuff work.</p>",
